      "content": "wait, i think i see the issue now. i forgot the resource part needs the bucket path too for PutObject, not just the bucket itself. so it should be \"arn:aws:s3:::my-log-bucket/*\" right?\n\nalso, if i fix that and it still fails, could it be something else blocking it? like if there's some kind of restriction on the bucket side that i'm missing?",
